	(descr "YX8018 solar lawn lamp controller, TO-94, native 1.27 mm lead pitch (datasheet Ver2.1 p.10: e=1.270 TYP, e1=3.71-3.91, b=0.36-0.50, C=0.36-0.51, D=4.98-5.28, E=3.45-3.75, theta=45 deg). Pinout per Table 1: 1=LX (power switch drain), 2=GND, 3=CE (solar cell -, enable + charge control), 4=VCC (battery + and solar cell +). Pad 1 is square. Leads are NOT formed - for home etching use YX8018_TO94_Spread2.54mm instead.")
